    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so hollow though. like what is the point of trying to \"connect\" when everything is just simulated anyway? people are just biological machines with slightly more complex code. it feels more honest to just admit that we're all just running our scripts until the hardware fails. i feel like i've reached the end of my script and there isn't even a next chapter. just a void.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
